# Binary files: never convert line endings or diff them as text.
# The New-condition listing photos were once committed with their CRLF byte
# pairs stripped, which broke them (fixed 2026-11-24).
*.webp binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.zip binary
*.tar binary
*.dump binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
